    <h3 id="touchdesigner-book-title" class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">The Interactive &amp; Immersive HQ</h3>
    <p class="mb-4">The Interactive &amp; Immersive HQ brings together training, workshops and community for TouchDesigner and interactive media.</p>
    <p class="mb-4">Elburz Sorkhabi is a co-founder and one of the leading authorities on TouchDesigner.</p>
    <p class="mb-4">He is the author of An Introduction to TouchDesigner, the first book ever written on TouchDesigner (088 era), published open source and free under Creative Commons, with a foreword by Greg Hermanovic, founder of Derivative.</p>
    <ul class="space-y-4">
      <li><a class="text-wavgen-yellow underline" href="https://interactiveimmersivehq.github.io/touchdesigner-book/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">An Introduction to TouchDesigner</a> <span class="text-gray-300">— free and open source; read online or download PDF/ePub.</span></li>
      <li><a class="text-wavgen-yellow underline" href="https://interactiveimmersive.io/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">The Interactive &amp; Immersive HQ</a></li>
