    </ul>
  </article>
  <article id="hou2touch" class="resource-card rounded-xl border-2 border-wavgen-purple p-6 mb-6" aria-labelledby="hou2touch-title">
    <h3 id="hou2touch-title" class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">Hou2Touch</h3>
    <p class="mb-4">Hou2Touch is Stanislav Glazov's school for learning TouchDesigner together with Houdini through the procedural approach.</p>
    <p class="mb-4">As its founder and course author, Stanislav Glazov focuses on procedural mentality and pipeline building.</p>
    <p class="mb-4">It teaches the way of thinking and the workflow, how to structure work and build a clear pipeline, not the programs and buttons.</p>
    <a class="text-wavgen-yellow underline" href="https://hou2touch.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Hou2Touch</a>
