<section class="container mx-auto px-4 py-12 deep-dive" id="deep-dive"><p class="text-wavgen-yellow">FROM THE ARCHIVE / 2020</p><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">TouchDesigner Deep Dive</h2>
<p>This archive revisits my learning journey, from analog VJing in Toronto to the 2012 MUTEK workshop and real-time visual systems. It reflects the tools and resources discussed in the original 2020 deep dive, rather than a current software reference.</p>
<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 my-8">
<article><h3>Learning through operators</h3><p>Study operator families, inspect OP Snippets and Palette examples, and build reusable components with clear inputs and outputs.</p></article>
<article><h3>Real-time performance</h3><p>Explore PBR materials, Substance textures, scene switching, TDAbleton audio reactivity, touchscreen widgets, and MIDI control through the Alpha performance system.</p></article>
<article><h3>Mapping and spatial work</h3><p>The journey includes Kantan Mapper, CamSchnapper, VR sculpting, and bringing reduced-polygon models into visual experiments.</p></article>
<article><h3>Connected systems</h3><p>OSC, Touch In/Out, shared memory, and NDI connect machines and creative applications. Python, GLSL, and C++ offer deeper customization.</p></article>
</div>
<h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">Community and learning resources</h3><p>The original collection brings together tutorials, community tools, workshops, and people who shaped the journey.</p>
<ul class="my-6"><li><a href="https://www.simonaa.media/tutorials/noisedisplacement">Simon Alexander Adams: noise displacement</a></li><li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ty6pCyTIUyM">Jarrett Smith: widget layouts</a></li><li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FImsLtt4Ab4">Markus Heckmann: introduction to GLSL</a></li><li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ref56jIJ5qo">Ivan DelSol: TDAbleton</a></li><li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLs0WlHa1rf208I8fyCNIuOtPBocQz8yd-">Matthew Ragan: generative media for live performance</a></li></ul>
<p><a href="https://derivative.ca/community-post/touchdesigner-deep-dive-2020/71536">Read my complete Deep Dive and original tutorial catalogue on Derivative</a>. Archive links have not all been revalidated.</p>
